        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82518,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saber a soma dos números em listas é útil ao comparar diferentes conjuntos de dados, como a diferença nas inscrições semanais ao longo de dois meses.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"signups_june = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"signups_july = [\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Method call",
            "id": 82519,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para calcular o total de uma lista, usamos <code>sum()</code>, com o nome da lista entre parênteses, como <code>sum(signups)</code> aqui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"signups = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(signups))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"68\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>sum</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>signups</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Negative numbers",
            "id": 82520,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando uma lista também contém números negativos como <code>-3</code>, os números negativos são subtraídos da soma dos números positivos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quarterly_growth = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(quarterly_growth))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Save in variable",
            "id": 82521,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para reutilizar a soma da lista <code>scores</code>, podemos armazenar o resultado em uma variável como <code>total</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>total</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>sum(scores)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Armazene o total da lista <code>scores</code> em <code>total</code>, para que o código exiba <code>22</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min(scores)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>total</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>sum(scores)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que <code>sum()</code> faz quando usado em uma lista de números?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele soma os números na lista</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele nos diz o número de elementos na lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele soma os números na lista.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A função <code>sum()</code> soma os números de uma lista.</p><p>A lista é <code>points = [4, 6, 3]</code>. O que <code>sum(points)</code> nos dá?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>13</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, porque a lista tem três valores</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code>, porque é o maior valor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Negative numbers",
            "id": 82691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando usamos <code>sum()</code> em uma lista que contém números negativos?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Vamos obter a soma dos números positivos, menos a dos negativos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Os números negativos não serão levados em consideração</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Vamos obter a soma dos números positivos, menos a dos negativos.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando <code>sum()</code> usa uma lista com números negativos, esses valores reduzem o total.</p><p>O que <code>sum([7, -2, 1])</code> retorna?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>6</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>8</code>, porque o valor negativo é ignorado</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code>, porque o valor negativo é subtraído duas vezes</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 82692,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como podemos reutilizar o resultado de <code>sum()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nós salvamos o resultado em uma variável</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos reutilizar o resultado de usar <code>sum()</code> em uma lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nós salvamos o resultado em uma variável.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos reutilizar o resultado de <code>sum()</code> salvando-o em uma variável.</p><p>Qual linha armazena o total de <code>expenses</code> em <code>total</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>total = sum(expenses)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>total == sum(expenses)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>total = expenses</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>total = sum(expenses)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Method call",
            "id": 82693,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Some os preços em um carrinho de compras online com <code>sum()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(cart))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"86\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>sum</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>cart</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A lista <code>cart</code> contém os preços de três itens. Exiba o preço total, <code>86</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(cart))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"max\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"50\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"86\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>sum</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>cart</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Negative numbers",
            "id": 82694,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique <code>-3</code> pontos de penalidade para que <code>sum(points_penalties)</code> resulte em <code>7</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"points_penalties = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(points_penalties))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O segundo número, <code>10</code>, é um bônus. Defina o primeiro número para que as penalidades e o bônus somem <code>7</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"points_penalties = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(points_penalties))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-7\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Save in variable",
            "id": 82695,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salve a quantidade total de açúcar necessária para uma receita de bolo na variável <code>total</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sugar = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(sugar)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"170\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>total</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>sum(sugar)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Some as duas quantidades de açúcar e armazene o resultado em <code>total</code>, para que o código exiba <code>170</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sugar = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(sugar)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"max(sugar)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"170\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>total</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>sum(sugar)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
